WEBVTT

00:07:59.189 --> 00:08:01.096
and television contracts.

00:08:01.096 --> 00:08:03.299
Suddenly, anybody who could be an NBA player

00:08:03.299 --> 00:08:04.495
wanted to be,

00:08:04.495 --> 00:08:06.341
and teams started scouring the globe

00:08:06.341 --> 00:08:08.621
for the bodies that could
help them win championships.

00:08:08.621 --> 00:08:10.364
Almost overnight,

00:08:10.364 --> 00:08:11.742
the proportion of men in the NBA

00:08:11.742 --> 00:08:13.634
who are at least seven feet tall doubled

00:08:13.634 --> 00:08:15.399
to 10 percent.

00:08:15.399 --> 00:08:17.422
Today, one in 10 men in the NBA

00:08:17.422 --> 00:08:19.604
is at least seven feet tall,

00:08:19.604 --> 00:08:21.753
but a seven-foot-tall man is incredibly rare

00:08:21.753 --> 00:08:23.272
in the general population --

00:08:23.272 --> 00:08:25.922
so rare that if you know an American man

00:08:25.922 --> 00:08:27.327
between the ages of 20 and 40

00:08:27.327 --> 00:08:29.463
who is at least seven feet tall,

00:08:29.463 --> 00:08:31.235
there's a 17 percent chance